+          <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="改写场景"><button id="tab-report" class="tab active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="sample-panel" data-mode="report"><svg><use href="#doc"/></svg>改周报</button><button id="tab-email" class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="sample-panel" data-mode="email" tabindex="-1"><svg><use href="#mail"/></svg>改邮件</button></div>
+          <div id="sample-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-report" tabindex="0">
+            <div class="original"><div class="field-label"><span>你的初稿</span><span class="muted">想法写下来就好</span></div><p id="original-text">这周做了新版首页，跟设计对了两次，周四上线了。还处理了 3 个用户反馈。下周看看数据，再改改注册流程。</p></div>
+            <div class="rewrite-divider"><span><svg><use href="#spark"/></svg>落笔，理一理</span><span id="tone-label">清晰 · 有重点</span></div>
